    "detailed_description": "Food Fight! Fight with Food! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFoodFighters is an online multiplayer top-down shooter. Join with your friends to fight each other by building food weapons and armor! <br />\r\nDifferent food items allow different combinations. Explore endless possibilities building weapons, armor, traps, and cuisine!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can also eat, throw, or drop your food items. Manage your inventory and strategize your combat to claim victory against your opponent!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCustomize your character with colorful skins! We have Turkey, Pumpkin..wait, isn't Thanksgiving over? Oh well.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDifferent game modes (team, singleplayer)<br />\r\nMap including different food items<br />\r\nSeveral Combination items for each food item<br />\r\nSeveral skins displayed in a skin selection page<br />\r\nInventory system below gameplay screen<br />\r\nGame option menu (Sound control)",
    "about_the_game": "Food Fight! Fight with Food! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFoodFighters is an online multiplayer top-down shooter. Join with your friends to fight each other by building food weapons and armor! <br />\r\nDifferent food items allow different combinations. Explore endless possibilities building weapons, armor, traps, and cuisine!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can also eat, throw, or drop your food items. Manage your inventory and strategize your combat to claim victory against your opponent!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCustomize your character with colorful skins! We have Turkey, Pumpkin..wait, isn't Thanksgiving over? Oh well.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDifferent game modes (team, singleplayer)<br />\r\nMap including different food items<br />\r\nSeveral Combination items for each food item<br />\r\nSeveral skins displayed in a skin selection page<br />\r\nInventory system below gameplay screen<br />\r\nGame option menu (Sound control)",
    "short_description": "Food Fight! Fight with food! Collect food items and combine them into weapons and armor for the most delicious battle yet!",
